<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:20:33 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>两颗心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9e9dbacc05</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两颗心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two hearts drawn on a black surface through a thin layer of ice. A larger heart and a smaller one, rotated by 90 degrees, next to it.  The title could refer to the song of the same name by Phil Collins, Chris Isaak or Stacey Q, depending on how old one is and what sort of music one listened to back then. " height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6af9e9dbacc05.jpg" width="3449"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:20:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9ca9a665e9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐。自制饼干配培根肉汁和芝士炒蛋。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Wide angle view of Amy's back, facing the sink. To her right two pans of homemade biscuits on the counter. To her left on the glass stovetop is the homemade bacon gravy and the scrambled eggs are just out of view." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6af9ca9a665e9.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:07:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>灰天偶现晴空美</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9b04fafd93</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是一个灰蒙蒙的日子，但有时阳光穿透云层，天空变得如此美丽。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A landscape with a large church and gorgeous sky " height="2072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6af9b04fafd93.jpg" width="2072"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11月15日运势：财务与机遇</title><link>https://some.pics/6af996eb285a0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日簿 · 2026年11月15日
阅读：方块十
有利焦点：将财务机会转化为更稳定的收入；为停滞的计划争取稳妥的批准；加强能够重新开启机会的人脉联系
包含辅助时机窗口。

日簿：https://mizjeannie.com/daybook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Daybook for November 15, 2026: an illustrated Ten of Diamonds, the daily reading, three favored magical focuses and their supporting timing windows." height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af996eb285a0.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:26:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日对应：2026年11月15日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9921298159</link><description>&lt;p&gt;**今日对应 — 2026年11月15日**

黄金 · 黄水晶 · 薄荷

&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 15, 2026. Color: Gold — clarity, study, prosperity, success. Crystal: Citrine — prosperity, clarity, confidence, success. Herb: Peppermint (Mentha × piperita) — clarity, prosperity, healing, communication. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af9921298159.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:05:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>墨西哥街头塔可餐车</title><link>https://some.pics/6af985329aa17</link><description>&lt;p&gt;墨西哥美食车！街头塔可真是让人爱不释手。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two crispy corn tostadas topped with seasoned ground beef, green salsa, diced white onion, and cilantro sit on a glass plate beside a fresh lime." height="3765" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af985329aa17.jpg" width="2824"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:11:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>不必过度解读巧合</title><link>https://some.pics/6af92b001f595</link><description>&lt;p&gt;不是每个巧合都需要赋予神奇的意义。如果你连续几个早晨看到同一只鸟，你可以享受观察它的过程，而不必认定这是什么征兆。 practicing witchcraft并不意味着你必须解读一切。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook witch with a breakfast mug watches a brown sparrow at an open window. Rose-pink curtains frame a railway curving upward through clouds, with ivory lettering on charcoal walls and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Not every coincidence needs a magical meaning. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af92b001f595.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:46:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>闪亮的圣诞甲虫</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9134ba9a7a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只闪亮的圣诞甲虫。我以前从未见过。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A beetle on a speckled kitchen island. Zoomed in very close. The back shell is a nice cream colour and the head and forward shell are an almost iridescent green/gold." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6af9134ba9a7a.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:05:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6af8e13c6e367</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="White clouds scattered across a clear blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6af8e13c6e367.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:31:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>画质一般但8倍变焦夜景</title><link>https://some.pics/6af8cb05e969b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;质量不是最好，但那是8倍变焦拍的。昨晚拍的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the moon with what i think is a star because there was no planet there in the sky map" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af8cb05e969b.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:56:40 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>